      "content": "Good-Enough Balance"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "A tree exhibits good-enough balance if the left and right subtrees of every node are of similar height and depth."
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "alt": "A Tree With Good-Enough Balance",
      "src": "data:image/png;base64,"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Here, every level of the tree must be filled except for the bottom level."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "In most cases of binary trees, this is the best balance we can achieve."
    },
